nvcuda (SveSop/nvcuda d4c0fca): D3D11 interop through host copies; D3D handles through Wine's D3DKMT.

- cuGraphicsD3D11RegisterResource and the cuGraphics map/unmap/array/flags/unregister calls for D3D11 2D
  textures: a CUDA array of the texture's format, filled from the texture on map and copied back on unmap
  (through a staging texture). The native driver cannot see a D3D11 resource under Wine.
- cuImportExternalMemory: D3D12_HEAP/D3D12_RESOURCE/D3D11_RESOURCE (and KMT) handles, also by name, become
  OPAQUE_FD through D3DKMT_ESCAPE_GET_RESOURCE_FD_WINE (AdobeWine Wine patch 0081); the wine-staging IOCTL
  stays as fallback.
- cuImportExternalSemaphore: D3D12_FENCE/D3D11_FENCE become TIMELINE_SEMAPHORE_FD through
  D3DKMT_ESCAPE_GET_SYNC_FD_WINE.
After Effects' composition/layer viewers show CUDA-rendered frames with these (they stayed black).

